	_________________________________________________________________

	                        S3-ST Version 2.00
	                        ==================

	                File Transfer and Utilities Program

	                 Atari 680x0 --- Psion Series 3/3a

	       Copyright (c) Keith Baines, March 1993 - August 1995
	_________________________________________________________________

	There are many changes for version 2. Highlights are:
	 * Much faster file copying.
	 * New full and incremental backup option.
	 * New file viewing mode.
	 * Uses file modified/archive status and file dates:
	   - modified files shown with a distinctive icon;
	   - new sort-by-date option;
	   - file copying options dialogue.
	 * Save up to 20 Psion paths for quick recall with function keys.
	_________________________________________________________________

	There are two files in this distribution of S3-ST:

	S3-ST200.DOC ....................   This file.

	S3-ST200.PRG ....................   A self-extracting archive
					    program containing all the
					    other S3-ST files.
